00:58:40.420 --> 00:58:47.110
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who attributes our success as a radio program entirely to--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ电台的管理监督是托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia），他将我们作为一档广播节目的成功完全归功于——

00:58:47.110 --> 00:58:49.820
<v Jack Hitt>Voodoo, the evil eye, pigs.
<v Jack Hitt>巫毒、邪眼、猪。

00:58:49.820 --> 00:58:55.380
